  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "On-Policy Omni Distillation (OPOD) and Student-Centered Distillation represent advancements in on-policy distillation frameworks that combine multimodal capabilities in a shared model, while addressing gaps between teachers and students in large language models. These approaches use route-based guidance and reinforcement learning to improve model performance. Beyond Routing Weights: Faithful Response-Level Interpretation of Mixture-of-Experts Reward Models via Contribution Contrast. Who Teaches Which Token? Verifier-Gated Multi-Expert On-Policy Distillation for Scientific Reasoning.",
